'' 'lbound( a )' / 'ubound( a )' of a FIXED array fold as constants, so a shared or static
'' array may name its own bounds in its initialiser (fbc's quirk/lubound.bas); tiko declined the
'' image. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/lbound-own-init.bas -o tests/codegen/lboundowninit.exe
